<title>MALAYSIA: Commerce Asset year net up 41 percent.</title>
<headline>Commerce Asset year net up 41 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     98.08    vs	79.10</p>
<p>    Net profit		267.56    vs     189.40</p>
<p>    Net income		779.09    vs     553.06</p>
<p>Pre-tax</p>
<p>profit 473.44 vs 330.81</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less  47.91    vs less 28.86</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	 12.0     vs	12.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Commerce Asset-Holding Bhd. It owns Bank of Commerce (Malaysia) Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
